{"asset_key":"mn3/quest_story_10295080","episode":"mn3","category":"quest_story","story_id":"10295080","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"say:2:1029508001:1":{"text":"아이가 한가득 있는 포춘 후르츠를 보면 굉장히 기뻐할 거예요.","source_cn":"这么多蜜果，我的孩子看到一定会非常开心的。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x0523D440225286A4","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1029508002:1":{"text":"이 많은 포춘 후르츠를 보니 저도 조금 먹고 싶네요…","source_cn":"看着满满一筐，我也有点想吃蜜果了……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x88B5B3311C5A0ED1","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1029508003:1":{"text":"페이 양, 집에 도착하면 가장 달콤한 포춘 후르츠를 대접할게요.","source_cn":"菲小姐，等到了我家，我会拿出最甜的蜜果招待你。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xBCC93EE319FD8FE5","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1029508004:1":{"text":"감사합니다!","source_cn":"好耶！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x164B34D0925A8CC7","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:女村民泰瑟丝":{"text":"마을 주민 테이스(여)","source":"女村民泰瑟丝","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:菲":{"text":"페이","source":"菲","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":5,"localized_text_count":4,"speaker_count":2}}